<description>&lt;p&gt;A study found transgender people in Kashmir face family violence, school exclusion and workplace harassment. Officials seized land of five Pakistan-based militants in Reasi under UAPA for alleged militant funding. The Jammu Kashmir Police sanctioned Rs 5.5 lakh each to families of two SPOs killed in Kishtwar. Manipur police arrested seven KCP cadres, recovered arms, and the SS chairman of the banned UPPK was among eight militants nabbed in Manipur. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNZDBKb0F1SFA3LXp2NFlLb1JhUEwwQWUwLUhMLVY3TjNJZmhUOThJWV8wMy1RdEJnRU92T2ZyVE5jeVY5MGh6aV82Q0NJSFZxRGFuUlZDRFktRG9udDNXVE9BMWRaMVdCdVRPX0F6WnZ6aHFJTjVubTBNR2xtZ2FkUXEtYjNLN2RXaFE1VlBlODdYYTlxa0t6MW5BTFIzM1FpUUdnS0RBV1laQ0pQVlRndmc5NG1oYzNseTdXVjAzcjdHZVdK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Press Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Live Law&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQNW1QUl82TDdKZlZiVVdza2JWSzFDTEpqaEJzNE5halFuNE5zSzlmRVlVcHl2R2E4UF91b3VjczhvNjJ2Ujg3ZTg3VGNLLWQ0cG12c0pPMXYyNFRMR0ZVYnhBb0xwZGFoaGxXZmdfdFBoRGhaTzNmeTBYY2RpTmRSRlZCZ0VnR2JEMTVlMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nagaland Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOUVJNRGtPMlp2S3FmeXVJRU1lMHhVSjdQejdmS0xkRXNOMm03QUZscFJqNG50RnZscUdWX01OSkNRc2RXM0gxMnM4Qi16VjJCUC1iaUFCbDN0Qm9Eb3FOM3V4eVhxR2R1cG5LRG1pbnQ1SEJtTTNzNUNsSWVORzhKQmlSWnc4TFoteFp1eTN6bzVOeXc1OHZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nagaland Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQTXo5QUxEUEtSU3dscHZBdjA4bmxycGR1TFVIWlBQb2VFTnFoUExWcVQ0bkpFSmgwSzZrWGE4bVl3Vy1XYnZCTy14VjJ6NTFZYkFEVGlUUmNzQWMxS2FmWExNT0hhbXM5NHJ6X0xEY